# {{TOOL_NAME}}

Use `{{TOOL_NAME}}` for anything that needs {{THIRD_PARTY}} state, such as when the user wants to {{PRIMARY_TRIGGER}} or {{SECONDARY_TRIGGER}}. Not for {{OUT_OF_SCOPE_CASE}}.

