## Report

Finish with what you did and what you observed: the objects you changed (refs or URLs, from the receipts), what was delivered and to whom, what the receipts verified, anything unknown or unresolved, and anything you did not do and why. Never present a dry-run as done, a partial result as success, or an incomplete list as complete.
